      "id": "insert-wire-trace",
      "name": "InsertWireTrace",
      "category": "KismetCompiledFunctionContext",
      "signature": "InsertWireTrace(Target, Goto Statement, Associated Exec Pin)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FKismetFunctionContext*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Goto Statement",
          "type": "FBlueprintCompiledStatement*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Associated Exec Pin",
          "type": "UEdGraphPin*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Makes sure an KCST_WireTraceSite is inserted before the specified\nstatement, and associates the specified pin with the inserted wire-trace\n(so we can backwards engineer which pin triggered the goto).\n@param  GotoStatement\t\tThe statement to insert a goto before.\n@param  AssociatedExecPin\tThe pin responsible for executing the goto."
    },
